- Add `implementation 'org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-coroutines-play-services:1.8.1'`.
- Or use a Task listener + CountDownLatch (blocking in worker thread) — avoid another dependency.

I'll use CountDownLatch + addOnSuccessListener/addOnFailureListener in a non-suspend `run(bitmap): List<LayoutBlock>` called from within `runBlocking`... actually simpler to make LayoutOcr.run synchronous-blocking using CountDownLatch, called directly on the ocrHandler worker thread. No coroutines needed, no extra dep. 

